# Documentation Source Of Truth

- Each document should have one responsibility.
- Update the existing source-of-truth document instead of creating a parallel explainer.
- `README.md` is for setup and orientation.
- `AGENTS.md` is for fast repository context for AI assistants and new contributors.
- `docs/architecture/` is for system structure and boundaries.
- `docs/decisions/` is for long-lived architectural choices.
- `docs/engineering/feature-workflow.md` is for lightweight planning structure.
